{"title":"Mire Bog","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 37 Bog that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">corrode</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\">Special: mireChance: .35 | mireSlowMs: 2500</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Appearance</h2><p class=\"s muted\">How the game draws it. Archers and mages wear better armor as their level goes up.</p><div class=\"look-grid\"><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/37c1e6da0ec4ec309f92.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Plain</b><div class=\"g-note\">Any level</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/8b24c9edbe6fd6fb7249.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Archer</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 25–44 · Werewolfpelt armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/e5570c6a2e5e3e9d5f71.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Acid)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 25–44 · Ogrewax armor</div></div></div></div>\n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 9 recorded drops, 315 total, 12–49 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">9 drops</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>Sunken Trove</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 9</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-2005\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Bog: <a href=\"#/monster/bogling\">Bogling</a> <span class=\"muted\">(25)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/bog\">Bog</a> <span class=\"muted\">(30)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/elder-bog\">Elder Bog</a> <span class=\"muted\">(35)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ancient-bog\">Ancient Bog</a> <span class=\"muted\">(40)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/8b24c9edbe6fd6fb7249.webp\" alt=\"Mire Bog\"></div><h3>Mire Bog</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>37</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 37)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Bog</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>crush · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>168</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>24.9</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1,850</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.6 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>9 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}